# BEADS runtime is handled by .beads/.gitignore (created by `bd init`).
# Do NOT exclude .beads/plans/, .beads/context/, .beads/knowledge/, or .beads/issues.jsonl
# from this root .gitignore — those are the metaswarm workflow's portable, cross-machine
# state and MUST be committed so other clones (and future you on a new laptop) can recover.
